{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Quarked Up Omnibus: Clean - Fix - Escape",
    "steam_appid": 1408130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/46b4bceb96ae8dce6c5252ced3888245.avif?t=1750888358\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Quarked Up Omnibus, a solar system of authored planets to explore, rooms to clean, entities to chat with, and a resort that doesn\u2019t seem as it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/021a9c8c9b455f38fec0dd1f6fc1106a.avif?t=1750888358\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is a mess, and you are a janitor. Your job is to clean, but that doesn\u2019t stop you from cleaning the mess that you see everywhere you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/6251289866bfd9c609ff83e08306ac14.poster.avif?t=1750888358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/6251289866bfd9c609ff83e08306ac14.webm?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/6251289866bfd9c609ff83e08306ac14.mp4?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/2cb04a7c7c2e815e6ccd87cde4a82d93.avif?t=1750888358\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry, you will be rewarded for your hard work via Resort tokens, this wonderful currency, <i>only legal at resort certified shops</i>, allows you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new cleaning tools to become more efficient</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your ship to improve exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw it all into getting random knick-knacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/856d51f9da61e4bdd3e020c0e57e7d27.poster.avif?t=1750888358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/856d51f9da61e4bdd3e020c0e57e7d27.webm?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/856d51f9da61e4bdd3e020c0e57e7d27.mp4?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/a2a417559725fce377c0a939ec222213.avif?t=1750888358\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work as a janitor at a school on a small planet, but you have higher ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your boss sends you to a fancy unknown resort for doing a great job, at first you feel as though you are finally being noticed and on your way to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This quickly changes when the day to leave the resort comes and goes, and your daily events turn into daily jobs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must gather a team to escape while keeping your wits about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/64ef775a94a2ef4af60bdb95b049d904.poster.avif?t=1750888358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/64ef775a94a2ef4af60bdb95b049d904.webm?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/64ef775a94a2ef4af60bdb95b049d904.mp4?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/46b4bceb96ae8dce6c5252ced3888245.avif?t=1750888358\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Quarked Up Omnibus, a solar system of authored planets to explore, rooms to clean, entities to chat with, and a resort that doesn\u2019t seem as it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/021a9c8c9b455f38fec0dd1f6fc1106a.avif?t=1750888358\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is a mess, and you are a janitor. Your job is to clean, but that doesn\u2019t stop you from cleaning the mess that you see everywhere you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/6251289866bfd9c609ff83e08306ac14.poster.avif?t=1750888358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/6251289866bfd9c609ff83e08306ac14.webm?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/6251289866bfd9c609ff83e08306ac14.mp4?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/2cb04a7c7c2e815e6ccd87cde4a82d93.avif?t=1750888358\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry, you will be rewarded for your hard work via Resort tokens, this wonderful currency, <i>only legal at resort certified shops</i>, allows you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new cleaning tools to become more efficient</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your ship to improve exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw it all into getting random knick-knacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/856d51f9da61e4bdd3e020c0e57e7d27.poster.avif?t=1750888358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/856d51f9da61e4bdd3e020c0e57e7d27.webm?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/856d51f9da61e4bdd3e020c0e57e7d27.mp4?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/a2a417559725fce377c0a939ec222213.avif?t=1750888358\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work as a janitor at a school on a small planet, but you have higher ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your boss sends you to a fancy unknown resort for doing a great job, at first you feel as though you are finally being noticed and on your way to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This quickly changes when the day to leave the resort comes and goes, and your daily events turn into daily jobs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must gather a team to escape while keeping your wits about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/64ef775a94a2ef4af60bdb95b049d904.poster.avif?t=1750888358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/64ef775a94a2ef4af60bdb95b049d904.webm?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408130/extras/64ef775a94a2ef4af60bdb95b049d904.mp4?t=1750888358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
    "short_description": "Quarked Up Omnibus is a 2D space exploration adventure game where you can walk around planets, and seamlessly fly to numerous other planets. Clean, Fix, and Exterminate your way through a day-by-day story, and plot your escape.",
